  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Proposed Development: Outbuilding/gym",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore not a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed outbuilding would contain primary living accommodation. The applicant has failed to demonstrate to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that the proposed outbuilding is required for a purpose incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse, which has already been substantially extended and has an extant planning permission for a detached annexe in the rear garden. Therefore the proposed development is not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The applicant has submitted inconsistent information in relation to the height of the proposed outbuilding. Therefore, the applicant has failed to demonstrate to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority that the proposed development would be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E, E.1 (e) (i) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
